# Parley environment variables
#
# API keys are configured in the app Settings window.
#
# Do not put Soniox, Anthropic, or OpenRouter keys in VITE_* variables:
# Vite exposes them to the frontend bundle.
#
# AI Pass account connection reads AIPASS_CLIENT_ID only in the native Rust
# build. Release builds inject it from protected configuration; never use VITE_*.
